{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:fcbb2ec9ad91fe21","name":"EduCorps","source":{"id":"source:reference-fcbb2ec9ad91fe21","title":"EduCorps","revision":19887,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:48:02Z","sha256":"6114be08ab51802beece93519a071f6221df0075cfac1fe76ead43e471685007","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19887","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=EduCorps&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-fcbb2ec9ad91fe21","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Educational Corps of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi","referenceId":"reference:d320edb17de6c558"}," instructs its recruits in the ways of imparting knowledge, teaching them not only to be effective instructors but also to show patience and compassion for their pupils. Above all, they need to understand that one cannot always rely on ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"}," to reach one's goal. The idea of forcing somebody to learn something through ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"}," violates the basic doctrines of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi Order"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi_Order"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The EduCorps provides instruction to the disadvantaged on countless worlds across the galaxy. Armed with the philosophy that knowledge of the universe and those who dwell in it increases one's understanding of life in the galaxy, these EduCorps scholars strive to learn all they can within the first few years of membership to prepare themselves to teach that knowledge to their future students. Members of 